    "B": "It exclusively centers the retelling of documented historical events through a self-aware fictional frame to expose the ideological constructedness of official historical narratives, rather than engaging with wholly invented storyworlds.",
    "C": "It positions sustained interrogation of storytelling’s formal and epistemological conventions as its central formal and thematic project, while systemically eroding the categorical boundary between fictional diegesis and lived extra-textual reality, rather than treating self-reflexivity as a secondary narrative ornament or limiting its critical scope to a single non-literary truth regime.",
